EvalTestStep {
  "type": "object",
  "description": "One authored test step (the unified test model). `kind` discriminates: `prompt` is a user message (model turn); `toolCall` is a deterministic, model-free tool call; `interact` is one pure widget action; `assert` is an assertion (a `Predicate` like `toolCalledWith` / `widgetRendered`, or a DOM `WidgetAssertion`).",
